{"id":"n88144-1-8","stage":2,"title":"회식 · 聚餐","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88144-1-8-1","ko":"여보! 오늘 언제 들어와요?","zh":"亲爱的！你今天什么时候回来？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여보!","meaning":"喂，老婆，老公","explanation":"여보：喂，老婆，老公。","readings":[{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58165","senseId":"1","lemma":"여보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여보","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3"}},{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：疑问词“什么时候”；结合本句询问时间。","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"들어와요?","meaning":"进，进来","explanation":"들어오다：进，进来；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"들어오다","audio":"/audio/bcc2ebb7204dcac8a7a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74105","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어와요","audio":"/audio/9cc9392f03c87ee7ca8d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7809541ae162d432","term":"여보","zh":"喂，老婆，老公","audio":"/audio/7809541ae162d432b91a.mp3","entryId":"58165","definition":"夫妇之间的称谓。","pronunciation":["여보"]},{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"什么时候","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"bcc2ebb7204dcac8","term":"들어오다","zh":"进，进来","au